      hu: ["A Papiliorama több mint 1000 szabadon repkedő pillangónak ad otthont.", "Az intézmény 2003-ban költözött át Kerzersbe.", "A Nocturama a világ egyik legnagyobb éjszakai állatbemutatója.", "A központ alapítványa több mint 110 négyzetkilométernyi erdőt véd Belize-ben.", "Évente megközelítőleg 250 000 látogató keresi fel a központot.", "A trópusi csarnok átmérője körülbelül 40 méter."],
      ro: ["Papiliorama găzduiește peste 1000 de fluturi care zboară liber.", "Mutarea în actuala locație din Kerzers a avut loc în anul 2003.", "Nocturama este una dintre cele mai mari expoziții de animale nocturne din lume.", "Fundația protejează peste 110 kilometri pătrați de pădure în Belize.", "Anual, complexul este vizitat de aproximativ 250.000 de persoane.", "Domul tropical are un diametru de aproximativ 40 de metri."],
      en: ["Papiliorama houses over 1,000 free-flying butterflies at any time.", "The facility was relocated to its current Kerzers site in 2003.", "The Nocturama is one of the world's largest nocturnal animal exhibits.", "The foundation protects over 110 square kilometers of forest in Belize.", "Approximately 250,000 people visit the center each year.", "The main tropical dome has a diameter of about 40 meters."],
